	(text "THE 6845, THE DOT CLOCK, THE DOT COUNTER, THE 6845'S CLOCK, THE STAGE REGISTERS" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5814e208-f1d7-5b1c-afaa-07c962cfec5b"))
	(text "IC11 counts the 25.175 MHz dot clock: D0-D3, the 16 dots of a count. The 6845's clock is D3 a dot late (IC12/A):\nit steps as dot 1 begins. IC15 / IC16, the stage, take MA0-9, DE, CURSOR, HSYNC and VSYNC as dot 0 begins (STG =\nNOT D3), 15 dots later: SA0-9, SDE, SCUR, SHS, SVS, steady for a count. IC12/B is SDE2, SDE as dot 8 begins.\nThe 6845's bus side: -CS = PA or PB (IC9/A, sheet 2), E = -IO-RD XOR -IO-WR (IC22/A), RS = IO-ADDR0." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b86bbadd-d7ee-5c85-bbf3-6c12f4dc5fae"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
